  "raw": "{\"teaching_intent\":\"让学生看到：同一抛出条件下，月面弱重力不改变水平匀速的本性感知，却会显著拉长竖直下落过程，从而改变轨迹形状、飞行时间、射程与能量分配节奏。学生可切换平抛/斜抛、调节初速、角度、高度与重力，观察速度/加速度矢量、动能势能占比和落地事件如何联动；用物理时间慢放、暂停、拖动来区分真实过程与演示倍率，并对比地球重力场景。\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='zh-CN'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>月面平抛与斜抛运动模型</title><!--HARNESS_PRIMITIVES--><!--HARNESS_MODEL--><!--HARNESS_INPUT--><style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;background:#0b1020;color:#eef3ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}button,input,select{min-height:44px;min-width:44px;font-size:16px}.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px}header{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}.card{background:#141b33;border:1px solid #2a3766;border-radius:16px;padding:12px;margin-top:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0006}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:12px}@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px}@media(max-width:420px){.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}}label{display:grid;gap:6px;background:#0f1730;border:1px solid #26325e;border-radius:12px;padding:9px}input[type=range]{width:100%}select,button{background:#22315f;color:#fff;border:1px solid #4b63aa;border-radius:12px;padding:8px 10px}button{cursor:pointer}.row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.pill{display:inline-block;background:#101a38;border:1px solid #33427d;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 10px;margin:3px}.read{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap}.svgbox{width:100%;height:min(58vh,560px);min-height:340px;background:linear-gradient(#0a1230,#07101f);border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #2c3d77}.bar{height:12px;background:#263058;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin:4px 0 10px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#59d4ff,#ffd166)}.moon{color:#9fe7ff}.earth{color:#ffb4a2}.hint{color:#aab8e8;font-size:14px}.big{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}.ok{color:#8dffc7}.warn{color:#ffd166}</style></head><body><div class='wrap'><header><div><div class='big'>月面平抛与斜抛运动模型</div><div class='hint'>拖时间、改参数：看弱重力如何“放大”飞行时间与射程，而不凭空改变受力方向。</div></div><div class='row'><span class='pill'>物理时间 <b data-physical-time>--</b></span><span class='pill'>演示倍率 <b data-demo-time>--</b></span><button data-replay>回放</button><button id='play'>播放</button><button id='pause'>暂停</button></div></header><div class='grid'><section class='card'><svg class='svgbox' viewBox='0 0 900 560' role='img' aria-label='轨迹对比图'><defs><marker id='arr' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='8' refY='5' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='6' orient='auto-start-reverse'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#fff'/></marker><marker id='arrR' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='8' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#ff6b6b'/></marker></defs><rect x='0' y='500' width='900' height='60' fill='#223050'/><line x1='0' y1='500' x2='900' y2='500' stroke='#d7e0ff' stroke-width='2'/><g id='grid'></g><polyline id='pathE' fill='none' stroke='#ff8f80' stroke-width='3' stroke-dasharray='7 6'/><polyline id='pathM' fill='none' stroke='#72e0ff' stroke-width='4'/><g id='ball'><circle r='10' fill='#fff'/><circle r='16' fill='none' stroke='#72e0ff'/></g><line id='v' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='0' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#arr)'/><line id='a' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='0' stroke='#ff6b6b' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#arrR)'/><text x='18' y='30' fill='#bcd0ff'>白箭头：速度方向　红箭头：加速度方向</text><text x='690' y='488' fill='#9fe7ff'>月面</text><text x='18' y='488' fill='#ffb4a2'>地球虚线对比</text></svg><div class='hint'>提示：落地后模型把高度钳到 0；暂停后仍可拖动进度，比较同一物理时刻两条轨迹。</div></section><aside class='card'><div class='controls'><label>模式<select id='mode' data-control><option value='horizontal'>平抛 horizontal</option><option value='oblique'>斜抛 oblique</option></select></label><label>初速 <span id='sv'>4.0</span> m/s<input id='spd' data-control type='range' min='0.5' max='8' step='0.1' value='4'></label><label>角度 <span id='av'>0</span>°<input id='ang' data-control type='range' min='-75' max='75' step='1' value='0'></label><label>高度 <span id='hv'>5</span> m<input id='hh' data-control type='range' min='0' max='15' step='0.5' value='5'></label><label>重力 <span id='gv'>1.62</span> m/s²<input id='gg' data-control type='range' min='0.8' max='12' step='0.01' value='1.62'></label><label>质量固定<select id='mass' data-control><option value='0.2'>0.2 kg</option></select></label></div><div class='card read' data-readout>等待模型采样…</div><div>动能占比<div class='bar'><i id='ek'></i></div>势能占比<div class='bar'><i id='ep'></i></div></div><div class='pill'>事件：飞行 <b id='ef'>--</b>｜射程 <b id='er'>--</b>｜最高点 <b id='eh'>--</b></div></aside></div></div><script>const $=q=>document.querySelector(q);const H=500,S=38;let inp0=globalThis.__HARNESS_INPUT__||{scenario:{angle_deg:0,g_m_s2:1.62,mass_kg:0.2,mode:'horizontal',speed_m_s:4,x0_m:0,y0_m:5},times_s:[0]};let states=[],est=[],events={},cur=0,timeline=null;const T=[];for(let i=0;i<=240;i++)T.push(12*i/240);function sc(){const m=$('#mode').value,a=+$('#ang').value;$('#sv').textContent=(+$('#spd').value).toFixed(1);$('#av').textContent=a;$('#hv').textContent=$('#hh').value;$('#gv').textContent=$('#gg').value;return{angle_deg:m==='horizontal'?0:a,g_m_s2:+$('#gg').value,mass_kg:0.2,mode:m,speed_m_s:+$('#spd').value,x0_m:0,y0_m:+$('#hh').value}}function X(x){return 30+x*S}function Y(y){return H-y*S}function near(list,t){const i=Math.max(0,Math.min(list.length-1,Math.round(t/12*(list.length-1))));return list[i]}function sampleAll(){const s=sc();const a=coursewareModel.sample({scenario:s,times_s:T});const e={...s,g_m_s2:9.8};const b=coursewareModel.sample({scenario:e,times_s:T});states=a.states;events=a.events;est=b.states;$('#pathM').setAttribute('points',states.map(p=>X(p.x_m)+','+Y(p.y_m)).join(' '));$('#pathE').setAttribute('points',est.map(p=>X(p.x_m)+','+Y(p.y_m)).join(' '));$('#ef').textContent=events.flight_time_s.toFixed(2)+' s';$('#er').textContent=events.range_m.toFixed(2)+' m';$('#eh').textContent=events.max_height_m.toFixed(2)+' m';render({physicalTimeS:cur,demoRate:timeline?lastRate:1,playing:false})}let lastRate=1;function line(el,x1,y1,x2,y2){el.setAttribute('x1',x1);el.setAttribute('y1',y1);el.setAttribute('x2',x2);el.setAttribute('y2',y2)}function render(st){cur=st.physicalTimeS;lastRate=st.demoRate;document.querySelector('[data-physical-time]').textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatPhysicalTime(st.physicalTimeS);document.querySelector('[data-demo-time]').textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatDemoRate(st.demoRate);const s=near(states,cur),e=near(est,cur);const x=X(s.x_m),y=Y(s.y_m);$('#ball').setAttribute('transform','translate('+x+' '+y+')');const vs=14,as=90;line($('#v'),x,y,x+s.vx_m_s*vs,y-s.vy_m_s*vs);line($('#a'),x,y,x+s.ax_m_s2*as,y-s.ay_m_s2*as);const me=s.mechanical_j||1;$('#ek').style.width=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,s.kinetic_j/me*100))+'%';$('#ep').style.width=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,s.potential_j/me*100))+'%';document.querySelector('[data-readout]').textContent='模式 '+sc().mode+'\\n位置 x='+s.x_m.toFixed(2)+' m, y='+s.y_m.toFixed(2)+' m\\n速度 v=('+s.vx_m_s.toFixed(2)+', '+s.vy_m_s.toFixed(2)+') m/s\\n加速度 a=('+s.ax_m_s2.toFixed(2)+', '+s.ay_m_s2.toFixed(2)+') m/s²\\n能量 K='+s.kinetic_j.toFixed(2)+' J, U='+s.potential_j.toFixed(2)+' J, E='+s.mechanical_j.toFixed(2)+' J\\n同刻地球高度 y='+e.y_m.toFixed(2)+' m；观察月面样本是否更晚触地'}function rebuild(){sampleAll();if(timeline)timeline.seek(Math.min(cur,12))}['mode','spd','ang','hh','gg','mass'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).addEventListener('input',rebuild));$('#mode').addEventListener('change',()=>{if($('#mode').value==='horizontal'){$('#ang').value=0}rebuild()});let g='';for(let i=0;i<=900;i+=90)g+='<line x1='+i+' y1=0 x2='+i+' y2=560 stroke=#1a2750 />';for(let j=0;j<=560;j+=70)g+='<line x1=0 y1='+j+' x2=900 y2='+j+' stroke=#1a2750 />';$('#grid').innerHTML=g;timeline=CoursewarePrimitives.createTimeline({durationPhysicalS:12,onChange:render});$('#play').onclick=()=>timeline.play();$('#pause').onclick=()=>timeline.pause();document.querySelector('[data-replay]').onclick=()=>timeline.replay();document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)timeline.pause()});rebuild();</script></body></html>\"}",
